		"PAD MODES: Pad mode, Keyboard, Chords, Step, Fixed velocity, Scene, Pattern, Events, Variation, Duplicate, Select, Solo, Mute"
	],
	"notice": "Use Maschine software for the integrated workflow. For accessibility, install NI Accessibility Helper and compatible Maschine 3 software and follow the manufacturer setup guide. Spoken feedback depends on those applications. For generic MIDI applications, switch to MIDI mode (Shift + Channel / MIDI) and configure a Controller Editor template. Pad notes, knobs and transport depend on that template; this profile does not assume a fixed map. Select the profile manually if the host does not identify it: no unverified port aliases are supplied. Diagrams are original simplified schematics, not scale drawings. Physical controls without a binding are informational; use MIDI learn for configurable assignments.",
